{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-206",
  "title": "Landing Headers",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Landing Headers"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Presence / Memory / Resistance**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Headline:** *Refusing to Disappear.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subline:** *Scholarship as presence. History as witness. Black France, remembered.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> clarity with quiet conviction — a nod to invisibility and refusal."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Futurity / Black Imagination / Hubble Energy**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Headline:** *We’ve Always Been Here.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subline:** *Across borders. Through time. Beyond the archive.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> cosmic, diasporic, insistent — invites the idea of lineage + timelessness."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Intellectual / Grounded / Journalistic**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Headline:** *The Record Is Not the Whole Story.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subline:** *Research, resistance, and what’s been left unsaid.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> scholarly rigor as an entry point — no mysticism, just the sharp truth."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Poetic / Reflective / Angelou-Inspired**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Headline:** *Here on the Pulse of This New Day.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subline:** *Work that looks up, and out — with grace, with hope, with memory.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> pulled straight from the poem Trica quoted — offers gentle strength and hope without cliché."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Experimental / Sci-fi / Archive-as-Spaceship**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Headline:** *This Is Not a Museum.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Subline:** *It lives. It breathes. It moves forward.*"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "> bold, perfect for the summer program or future-facing content. punches gently."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ">"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}